{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43122","headline":"秋夜宿淮口 · 景池","name":"秋夜宿淮口","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露白草犹青，淮舟倚岸停。\n风帆几处客，天地两河星。\n树静禽眠草，沙寒鹿过汀。\n明朝谁结伴，直去泛沧溟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"景池","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43122.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43122","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}